OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's care service still needs
OL,4,Aimprovement amid planned cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council's adult social care services
OL,7,Fhave again been rated as requiring
OL,8,Fimprovement by inspectors, as the
OL,9,Fauthority presses ahead with plans that
OL,10,Fcould see up to 100 jobs cut.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) said
OL,13,Fpeople's experiences of adult social
OL,14,Fcare provision at Warrington Council
OL,15,Fwere "mixed", but found signs of
OL,16,Fprogress in safeguarding following
OL,17,Fcriticism of the service last year.
OL,19,FThe report comes as the council looks
OL,20,Fto save about #34m from adult social
OL,21,Fcare as part of wider plans to reduce
OL,22,Fdebt.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
